sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in clean-v1, written as data: a template for table plugins, and a check on the engine
; (its survivors must be clean-v1's, exactly, at every length).
id        clean-data
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  No two SPACEs in a row, and at least one letter (clean-v1, as a plugin).

class     space   " "
class     letter  a-z

; 0 start, 1 space before any letter, 2 after a letter, 3 space after a letter
states    4
start     0
accept    2 3
t   0   space   1
t   0   letter  2
t   1   letter  2
t   2   letter  2
t   2   space   3
t   3   letter  2
end
